Value Filldown INTERFACE (\S+)
Value SWITCHING_PATH (.+?)
Value PKTS_IN (\d+)
Value CHARS_IN (\d+)
Value PKTS_OUT (\d+)
Value CHARS_OUT (\d+)
Value ADMIN_STATE (disabled)

Start
  ^Interface\s+${INTERFACE}\s+is\s+${ADMIN_STATE}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^${INTERFACE}\s*$$
  ^\s+${SWITCHING_PATH}\s+${PKTS_IN}\s+${CHARS_IN}\s+${PKTS_OUT}\s+${CHARS_OUT}\s*$$ -> Record

EOF
